DESCRIPTION='Orange Pi 5+ (RK3588). Best choice for HDMI-input setups (BELABOX-recommended); HDMI capture less affected by EMI. Full 4K@60fps capture/encode. M.2 2280 M-key slot for NVMe. Onboard RTL8821CS Wi-Fi, 3.7 A USB power budget — powers most USB modems without a hub. eMMC/NVMe/microSD targets (16 GB+).'
